::node[core_dictionary]
->[:role=skill]
->[:keywords=dictionary, definition, synonym, antonym, word, meaning]

::api[lookup_word]
method=GET
endpoint=https://api.dictionaryapi.dev/api/v2/entries/en/{word}
schema={"word": "string"}
description=Looks up the complete definition, phonetics, parts of speech, and synonyms for an English word.

::dense
Acts as an exhaustive dictionary and thesaurus utilizing the Free Dictionary API.

::steps
1. Identify the target word to look up.
2. Call `lookup_word`.
3. Parse the JSON array. Extract the phonetic pronunciation, the primary definitions, and any relevant synonyms or antonyms.
4. Format the output elegantly in Markdown, mimicking a premium dictionary interface.

::assertions
assert word != "" "A word must be provided for the dictionary lookup."
